        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "5 November 2026, 29 February in leap years and year 2000, years 275760 and −500 are created; 30 February, 29 February 2026 and 1900, and month 13 are invalid with their codes.",
        "Parsing 2026-11-05 gives the date; 2026-02-30 is invalid (day-out-of-range).",
        "Weekday is Thursday and ISO week 45; leap years agree with Year.isLeap (parameterized).",
        "5 Nov + 30 days; 31 Jan + 1 month is none (month-end), or 28 Feb with MonthEnd.CONSTRAIN; 31 Jan + P1M is none.",
        "5 Nov → 25 Dec is 50 days; isBefore orders dates; year 1,000,000,000 has no LocalDate (out-of-native-range)."
