      "criteria": [
        "November 2026 is a month without a day, and addMonths carries into the next year.",
        "09:30 writes no seconds; 09:30:00 does.",
        "23:30 + 2 hours carries into the next day; 14:30 with no zone is a floating date-time; 23:59:60 is unsupported (leap-second).",
        "inZone keeps the wall time and zone; atOffset and FixedOffsetDateTime.from pin a wall time to an offset; toInstant gives the UTC moment; toOffsetDateTime gives back the original.",
