      "id": "timestamps-amounts",
      "title": "Timestamps and amounts",
      "summary": "Now as an input, the epoch, nanoseconds, exact fractions, and periods, POSIX seconds and SI seconds kept apart.",
      "subject": [
        {
          "path": "implementations/java/src/main/java/net/icelander/utv/.dev/feature.json",
          "entityId": "exact-instants-and-seconds"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "Instant.from takes a clock reading as an input (a fixed reading, as java.time.Instant.now() would return it); the epoch; all nine fractional digits; a quarter second kept.",
        "Instant.until returns exactly 14403/4 s, and 23 hours between the noons around a spring-forward day; POSIX seconds move an instant exactly; SI seconds are unsupported (needs-leap-seconds).",
        "Period.days(1) is not 86,400 seconds; Period.months(1) is P1M, never PT1M.",
        "PosixSeconds holds a third exactly; ElapsedSeconds.of(5400) holds 90 minutes and is neither a calendar day nor POSIX seconds."
      ],
